xt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12109$673BD720-23BC-4256-9D4C-DA3BCCC1D358", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "4cf642265f3d792fd597b35fc4d24004a2999ba7", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1412, "id": "Q1412"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12109$9669C0E1-C07E-4977-B6DE-86B7C523E0D4", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "d91db034b02713555a5971651e2e1873f28710f0", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 61, "id": "Q61"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12109$DD2EF76A-5339-4560-B558-864040045B71", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "b7eaa6e89507dc6b54c3c4ba19db93a147ce8a6f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1386, "id": "Q1386"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12109$7BE694F7-7EED-494C-B274-F712FD1C2C25", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "c7e1e1023400f659b211fe58b5adf4a1a7e6634e", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1386, "id": "Q1386"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12109$FA0027D6-32BD-47C1-B8BE-F0A47B459498", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "00e19ef564c2c6a3243fbb327a71aa886ba057a9", "datavalue": {"value": "I don't know if I could explain it. It's a spiritual thing. Sometimes she feels grumpy and she doesn't want to be bothered and she doesn't want any food to eat. It all depends, but I don't come with stage fright, with an attitude. I watched Eartha Kitt with an attitude and I didn't understand it, but I understand it now. Dinah. Yeah. An attitude. You're not alone and sometimes you don't want to...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12109$9DB7EE93-2153-4A41-974F-B30A685073BA", "rank": "normal"}]}}